        <Abstract>
          <AbstractText>The use of AH8165, a new non-depolarising relaxant, for Caesarian section is reported. The rapidity of action and the absence of significant placental transfer of the drug were confirmed. AH8165 has a definite place in obstetric anaesthesia.</AbstractText>
